@startuml two-orders-same-result
title Either order, same end result

skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888888
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA

start

fork
  :Combined alert arrives first;
  :Shows on screen by itself\n(nothing to nest yet);
  :"Went dark" alert arrives\na moment later;
  :Now nests underneath\nthe combined alert;
fork again
  :"Went dark" alert arrives first;
  :Shows on screen as its own card;
  :Combined alert arrives\na moment later;
  :"Went dark" alert immediately\nmoves under it, marked replaced;
end fork

:Same end result either way:\none combined alert card,\nthe replaced alert nested\nunderneath it;

note right
  Whichever of the two alerts the
  system hears about first, the
  operator ends up looking at the
  identical, correct picture.
end note

stop
@enduml
